# Every entry says why it is accepted and what would let it be removed.

# glib 0.18.5, GHSA-wrw7-89jp-8q8g (MEDIUM): unsound VariantStrIter iterator.
# glib arrives only through Tauri's Linux GTK stack (tauri -> muda -> gtk 0.18
# -> glib 0.18), which Tauri pins; the app never iterates glib Variant
# strings. Remove when Tauri moves to gtk-rs 0.20 or later.
